        "ggxMfZJ8eAH_text": "<p>\"Imagine finally knowing — actually knowing — that what you're taking is real. Not hoping. Not trusting some label. Knowing.\"</p>",
        "ggHpZCZVzhB_childItem_0": "<p>Finally hit PRs again — without choking down chalky powder or mixing anything.</p>",
        "ggHpZCZVzhB_childItem_1": "<p>Sleep easy tonight — knowing you're not paying $50/month for flavored sugar.</p>",
        "ggHpZCZVzhB_childItem_2": "<p>Toss one in your bag and go — no containers, no sticky mess, no excuses.</p>",
