    "gp_section_603931699394380295": {
      "type": "gp-section-603931699394380295",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "ccf2aec8347a788c02acccf657eccf72aba5b08c2df91c4dcb2b4684f4d90be6_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggoyOEPZBti_text": "<p>4.8/5 from 12,847 verified reviews</p>",
        "ggIoi64seyS_text": "<strong>Real Results from </strong><span style=\"color:rgb(189,229,33);\"><i><strong>Real People</strong></i></span>",
        "gglxTUStVYH_text": "<p><strong>I did the math and now I'm actually mad</strong></p>",
        "ggw-RwziPRR_text": "<p>Okay so I'm the idiot who spent $847 on PUSH gummies over 14 months. BIOAVAILABILITY OF WHAT?? CORN SYRUP??? Anyway I've been taking FusiForce for 6 weeks and my bench is up 15lbs.</p>",
        "ggaD4cutt3o_text": "<p><strong>— Jake R., 34, Austin TX &nbsp;✓&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "gggJnhUAYZ2_text": "<p><strong>I paid $55 for literal candy</strong></p>",
        "ggZcRkCQhBe_text": "<p>Arrae \"Tone.\" Lemme \"Tone.\" All these brands marketing \"women's creatine\" with skinny models in leotards. I bought them. <strong>They contained basically NOTHING.</strong> Pink label, zero creatine. FusiForce posts their lab reports — I can literally verify what I'm paying for. My glutes finally have REAL fuel.</p>",
        "gg9rJ4P4-4H_text": "<p><strong>— Jessica M., 31, Portland OR ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggQVC5ocxPn_text": "<p><strong>My trainer roasted me so hard I switched careers. Jk but almost.</strong></p>",
        "ggePNPLRa8Q_text": "<p>This man said — I quote — \"bro you've been eating Haribo with extra steps.\" Then he SCREENSHOT it and sent it to our GROUP CHAT</p>",
        "ggXzpiVNPIv_text": "<p><strong>— Derek M., 29, Chicago IL ✓</strong></p>",
        "gg9hwJcfBYh_text": "<p><strong>I'm 5'2\" and was terrified of 'bulking up'</strong></p>",
        "ggN_e_AXI-s_text": "<p>Avoided creatine for YEARS because influencers made it sound like one gummy = instant She-Hulk. Spoiler: that's not how anything works. Three months on FusiForce: same 5'2\". Not bulky. But I can carry ALL my groceries in one trip now. <strong>Like a CHAMPION.</strong></p>",
        "ggFrl5V6ceD_text": "<p><strong>— Emma L., 29, Seattle WA ✓</strong></p>",
        "gglO68ZJIaF_text": "<p><strong>14 months of expensive candy</strong></p>",
        "ggqcjVgubVw_text": "<p>I trusted influencers. Bought what they promoted. Defended it to my gym friends. \"You don't understand bioavailability!\" Then the testing came out. <strong>ZERO creatine.</strong> I wasn't a non-responder. I was a scam victim. FusiForce shows their lab reports. My deadlift is up 25lbs. My trust in influencers is gone forever.</p>",
        "gg5QkazlOiw_text": "<p><strong>— Brittany N., 26, San Diego CA ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggiRvQasRqV_text": "<p><strong>I have beef with Gary and FusiForce is my weapon</strong></p>",
        "ggiK0q1sbiJ_text": "<p>Gary does curls in the squat rack. I looked him dead in his eyes and said \"nothing really, just genetics I guess.\" GARY LOOKED SO DEFEATED.</p>",
        "ggFB0yUp4_c_text": "<p><strong>—</strong> Chris P., 33, Boston MA <strong>✓</strong></p>",
        "ggguEv5Ez_W_text": "<p><strong>I accidentally started a cult at my office</strong></p>",
        "ggxcnf1i7by_text": "<p>KAREN DOESN'T EVEN WORK OUT. It's been 6 weeks. I have converted 11 coworkers to FusiForce. We have a Slack channel called #gummygang. IT flagged it.</p>",
        "ggQx8ePcYoy_text": "<p><strong>— Tyler B., 28, San Francisco CA ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggvdHCyW0cd_text": "<p><strong>I converted my entire book club</strong></p>",
        "ggjlk9QnnFo_text": "<p>We were supposed to discuss \"Lessons in Chemistry.\" Instead I gave a PowerPoint on creatine. Six weeks later, 7 members take FusiForce. We have a group chat called \"Creatine Queens.\" <strong>Karen hit 135lbs on squat. KAREN IS 54. WE CRIED.</strong></p>",
        "ggwFQUN465x_text": "<p><strong>— Michelle T., 42, Denver CO ✓</strong></p>"
      }
